				"string" : "Resources for creating responsive tables:\n[Kevin Powell - Responsive Table Design Video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=czZ1PvNW5hk)\n[Adrian Roselli’s in-depth article on responsive, accessible tables: ](https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUUdyaElGYVF2MUlJMTVNSTZnMW5MQXxBR3JiS2FtX1hhd2FJMkx4WW5rX2Q2eTNNOUZRd1IxT3JKanpjcjRVV0lYNWVqWWl3Vy0wSDNXLVNzZkY1dlpKejNtVV9Mb3Z6LVY4OE5xM1ljZmVJRnc2TVo2YnFnLVIxQzNC&q=https%3A%2F%2Fadrianroselli.com%2F2017%2F11%2Fa-responsive-accessible-table.html&v=czZ1PvNW5hk)"
