				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Design Principles\n1) Use The table tags - TD, TR, TH, etc\n2) Use display type of grid on the table\n3) Because grid display type is used, need to add role tag to the html so readers know what the tag is for.\n"
